This module is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE).

The code was written for SigmaM2M, a oneM2M platform, from the public
PI Web API reference and the Kerberos RFCs (PROVENANCE.md). It contains
no code from other projects. The source files that come from SigmaM2M
(sim/sim.go, sim/kdcsim/kdcsim.go) carry no per-file copyright header,
the convention of the code they come from; the copyright line above
covers them. Files added for this module carry "Copyright 2026 Abhinav
Gautam" and "SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0".

