Facts from other projects
-------------------------

Action paths, parameter names and field names were checked against
OSIsoft's PI Web API client for Python, generated from the PI Web API's
2018 description (Copyright 2018 OSIsoft, LLC, Apache License 2.0),
through the piwebapi module. Only interface facts were taken.

